v 3
d netcalc: directed edge variables from a panel of ordered node pairs
d
d Author: Necmi TALAY
d Support: https://github.com/aggilitas/stata-networks/issues
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261027
d
d Turns a long panel of ordered node pairs and periods into a
d panel of directed edge variables, ready for a fixed-effects
d estimator. Three templates: interaction, flow and attribute;
d interaction and flow split into subnets by a feature.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16 or higher (for frame support)
d
